Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 08:13:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(updates): GET /updates/count carries up to three story
 lines, read-only (frontend 06:30Z item 5)

The home card can call only the count, because GET /updates spends what it
returns. `lines` peeks at the first due updates with the count's own
conditions (a SELECT, nothing released or marked) and says each with the
card's existing title and detail, in the language GET /updates uses.

